The dictionary deduplication and block bit layout in src/map_converter.cpp
are adapted from src/core/PatternDictionaryBuilder.cpp and
src/model/VoxelGrid.cpp. The HDF5 packing convention in src/map_io.cpp
is adapted from src/io/HDF5IO.cpp. The adapted files identify changes.

Reference paper:
Ryo Funai, Yasuo Hayashibara, Ryuichi Ueda,
"Compression of 3D Occupancy Grid Map for Mobile Robot Localization
using Vector Quantization", 31st Robotics Symposia, 2026, pp. 15-21.

emcl3d informed the package layout. No emcl3d source is included.
